            "title": "Inspect a Delivery Response",
            "id": 152325,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Un rastreador de entregas necesita el estado numérico de la respuesta. Completa el acceso al atributo.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"status = response.status_code\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"18\" endIndex=\"29\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"ok\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Asegúrese de elegir <code>status_code</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Un rastreador de entregas necesita el estado numérico de la respuesta. Completa el acceso al atributo.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"status = response.status_code\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"18\" endIndex=\"29\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"ok\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"json\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Asegúrese de elegir <code>status_code</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Check GET Success",
            "id": 152326,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Completa la condición que reconoce una respuesta <code>GET</code> exitosa.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" response.status_code == \" /><text value=\"200\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Success&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"27\" endIndex=\"30\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"404\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Asegúrese de elegir <code>200</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Acepta solo el estado de éxito estándar de una respuesta <code>GET</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" response.status_code == \" /><text value=\"200\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Success&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"24\" endIndex=\"26\" /><option startIndex=\"27\" endIndex=\"30\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"!=\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"404\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"500\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Asegúrese de elegir <code>==</code> seguido de <code>200</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Recall Not Found",
            "id": 152327,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Que codigo de estado significa que no se encontro el recurso solicitado?</p><selection multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>404</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>200</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>500</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Asegúrese de elegir <code>404</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Solicitas una reserva que se eliminó. El servidor funciona, pero no la encuentra. ¿Qué código de estado corresponde?</p><selection multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>404</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>200</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>500</code></item><item value=\"4\" correct=\"false\"><code>201</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Asegúrese de elegir <code>404</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Report a Server Error",
            "id": 152328,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Completa la rama que reconoce un error interno del servidor.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" response.status_code == \" /><text value=\"500\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Server error&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"27\" endIndex=\"30\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"404\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Asegúrese de elegir <code>500</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Completa la rama que reconoce un error interno del servidor.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" response.status_code == \" /><text value=\"500\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Server error&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"12\" endIndex=\"23\" /><option startIndex=\"27\" endIndex=\"30\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"ok\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"200\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"404\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Asegúrese de elegir <code>status_code</code> seguido de <code>500</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Separate Error Branches",
            "id": 152329,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Escribe el código de estado utilizado para comprobar si el recurso no está disponible.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" response.status_code == \" /><text value=\"404\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Not found&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"elif\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" response.status_code == \" /><text value=\"500\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Server error&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" isDefault=\"true\" startIndex=\"27\" endIndex=\"30\" /></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Asegúrese de elegir <code>404</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Keep the New Booking",
            "id": 152330,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Una API de reservas creó una reserva con estado <code>201</code>. Completa la comprobación general de éxito.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" create_response.ok:\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Created&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"19\" endIndex=\"21\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"is_success\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Traceback (most recent call last):\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  File &quot;/home/code/file.py&quot;, line 1, in &lt;module&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    if create_response.ok:\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"NameError: name 'create_response' is not defined\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Asegúrese de elegir <code>ok</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Tu API de reservas devuelve <code>201</code>. Usa su propiedad general de éxito, que es false para respuestas de error.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" create_response.ok:\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Created&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"19\" endIndex=\"21\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"status_code\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"json\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Asegúrese de elegir <code>ok</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Choose the General Check",
            "id": 152331,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>¿Qué condición acepta tanto <code>200</code> como <code>201</code>, pero rechaza <code>404</code> y <code>500</code>?</p><selection multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>response.ok</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>response.status_code == 200</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>response.status_code == 404</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Asegúrese de elegir <code>response.ok</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>¿Qué condición acepta tanto <code>200</code> como <code>201</code>, pero rechaza <code>404</code> y <code>500</code>?</p><selection multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>response.ok</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>response.status_code == 200</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>response.status_code == 404</code></item><item value=\"4\" correct=\"false\"><code>response.status_code &lt; 500</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Asegúrese de elegir <code>response.ok</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Check Before JSON",
            "id": 152332,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>¿Qué línea debería ejecutarse antes de <code>response.json()</code> para que las respuestas HTTP fallidas detengan el procesamiento normal?</p><selection multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>response.raise_for_status()</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>response.status_code</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>response.ok</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Asegúrese de elegir <code>response.raise_for_status()</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Lees <code>response.ok</code>, pero el código aún analiza como JSON una respuesta fallida.</p><p>¿Qué línea antes de <code>response.json()</code> genera un error HTTP y detiene el procesamiento normal?</p><selection multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>response.raise_for_status()</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>response.status_code</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>response.ok</code></item><item value=\"4\" correct=\"false\"><code>response.json()</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>response.raise_for_status()</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Catch the HTTP Error",
            "id": 152333,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Escribe el nombre de la excepción que captura los errores de tipo <code>HTTPError</code> generados por <code>raise_for_status()</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"except\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" requests.exceptions.HTTPError:\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Request failed&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" isDefault=\"true\" startIndex=\"27\" endIndex=\"36\" /></interactions><output><content><text value=\"  File &quot;/home/code/file.py&quot;, line 1\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    except requests.exceptions.HTTPError:\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    ^\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"SyntaxError: invalid syntax\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Asegúrese de elegir <code>HTTPError</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Review Response Tools",
            "id": 152334,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Qué par lee primero el código exacto y comprueba después el éxito general?</p><selection multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>response.status_code, response.ok</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>response.ok, response.json()</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>response.json(), response.status_code</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>response.status_code, response.ok</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Qué par lee primero el código exacto y comprueba después el éxito general?</p><selection multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>response.status_code, response.ok</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>response.ok, response.json()</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>response.json(), response.status_code</code></item><item value=\"4\" correct=\"false\"><code>response.status_code, response.json()</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>response.status_code, response.ok</code>.</p></body></html>"
